{"title":"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">2009 AMC 12A #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">2009 AMC 10A #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/416ca8082b9761653a0b09f66e5731bbb2f29fe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac {1}{1 + \\frac {1}{1 + 1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"92\" height=\"45\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/1/d01fc0fe9e2e96e5c6d9e58afc118dfb93f5aa15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac {5}{4} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac {3}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac {5}{3} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We compute:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/4/ae413feea3e5114d1fe688e6ff8f66d7b8263732.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 1 + \\frac {1}{1 + \\frac {1}{1 + 1}} &amp;= 1 + \\frac {1}{1 + \\frac {1}{1 + 1}} \\\\ &amp;= 1 + \\frac {1}{1 + \\frac 12} \\\\ &amp;= 1 + \\frac {1}{\\frac 32} \\\\ &amp;= 1 + \\frac 23 \\\\ &amp;= \\frac 53 \\end{align*}\" width=\"209\" height=\"230\" />\n</p><p>This is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b317654f901a9c8f56585721a617396d3b050c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Interesting sidenote: The continued fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/90077679863b23822f5d142894720346979349a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac {1}{1 + \\frac {1}{1 + 1....}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"108\" height=\"45\" /> is equal to the golden ratio, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c2b2e9d216af3f6a5b1536d99a69aa9844a02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A\">2009 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC